# ===========================================================================
#  .gitignore
# ===========================================================================

# ---- build output: never commit -------------------------------------------
/bin/
/obj/
/dist/
*.pdb
*.user
*.suo

# ---- installer build leftovers --------------------------------------------
installer/*.log
installer/*.tmp

# ---- run logs: never commit -------------------------------------------------
# The launcher writes its own log to %LOCALAPPDATA%\MultisimLauncher\, which is
# outside this checkout. These rules are just a safety net so that a log can
# never be committed by accident, for example when a tool is run from inside
# the repository.
*.log
logs/

# ---- IDE / editor ----------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ---- OS noise --------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ===========================================================================
#  Exception: the shipped binaries ARE meant to be committed.
#
#  dist/ is build output and stays ignored. release/ holds the exact two files
#  a visitor should be able to download without a Releases page, so it is
#  un-ignored here. Negation rules must come LAST to win over *.log / logs/
#  above - an earlier revision of this file got that order wrong and both
#  binaries ended up ignored.
# ===========================================================================
!/release/
!/release/MultisimLauncher.exe
!/release/MultisimLauncher-Setup.exe
!/release/README.txt
!/assets/background.png
